                                "sense_id": "7b4b5cea-0810-3704-b394-536da3cb5db9",
                                "text": "Służby wyciągnęły z jeziora motocykl marki Honda."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b1a36109-3369-3354-9a45-d4a705d89e70",
                        "entry_id": "da2fb7f1-faf1-3dbb-8f85-b045fa5ce21b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "japońska firma motoryzacyjna"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "74920955-588c-46f5-b4e6-cac8699d2527",
                                "sense_id": "b1a36109-3369-3354-9a45-d4a705d89e70",
                                "text": "W kilku zakładach przemysłowych, m.in. Hondy, Toyoty i Nissana, przerwano lub ograniczono produkcję"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d1e381f9-0aac-4a8c-9cb9-5fccc8efc151",
                        "source_entry_id": "da2fb7f1-faf1-3dbb-8f85-b045fa5ce21b",
                        "source_sense_id": "7b4b5cea-0810-3704-b394-536da3cb5db9",
                        "target_lang_word": "Honda",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Honda",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6adaddf7-64f7-35d6-b30d-0e57e8458572",
                                        "entry_id": "5bb46f7a-55d0-3652-a87e-260d7550130e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A Japanese automotive and motorcycle manufacturer, named after its founder, Soichiro Honda."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec1f4c12-0090-437e-9595-318e7c6a84eb",
                                                "sense_id": "6adaddf7-64f7-35d6-b30d-0e57e8458572",
                                                "text": "they left on Sonnyʼs seventeenth birthday present — the Honda motorbike heʼd begged them to buy him"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37f4ea66-cbd0-3e30-84d3-a387f21445bd",
                                        "entry_id": "5bb46f7a-55d0-3652-a87e-260d7550130e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brand of car manufactured by Honda."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Honda",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb9ec258-3b2e-3d78-9440-f64a0480ca1b",
                                        "entry_id": "22e4d30f-fa26-3371-a81d-7f6ecd8044c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A car of the Honda brand."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0aa95084-0214-4d8a-a960-57fc1e045ef0",
                                                "sense_id": "eb9ec258-3b2e-3d78-9440-f64a0480ca1b",
                                                "text": "Jammed onto a narrow, steep sidewalk, police barricades all around, we march with placards, drums, and angry spirit: \"The Moral Majority, cops and Klan. Work together hand in hand.\" — helmeted tac squad on horses, Hondas, facing us on Powell Street, itching to wield their billy clubs, waiting for any excuse to let fly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c8c3ae8-fce5-49ca-adc5-9159e4ab2ace",
                                                "sense_id": "eb9ec258-3b2e-3d78-9440-f64a0480ca1b",
                                                "text": "Hondas sound like cars designed by pacifists and humanitarian diplomats. The Accord, Civic, Insight."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09dfb208-9ad0-46f6-a3ec-2283584d3862",
                                                "sense_id": "eb9ec258-3b2e-3d78-9440-f64a0480ca1b",
                                                "text": "It’s a little disconcerting to ponder how much of my happy online childhood was spent hanging out virtually with people who were old enough to own Hondas and go on PornHub^([sic]) on purpose (and definitely people old enough to be active on Reddit), but I loved being a Jammer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "184295ee-7fcb-37c8-bb4a-a7c9cf8cc8bb",
                                        "entry_id": "22e4d30f-fa26-3371-a81d-7f6ecd8044c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A motorbike manufactured by Honda."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
